<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-042" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang" source-id="s-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang-ws1507997">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p001:m0000" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">江祏</persName>字弘業，濟陽考城人也。祖遵，寧朔參軍。父<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p001:m0022" ref="q63_4br_3of">德隣</persName>，司徒右長史。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p002:m0000" ref="q63_4br_3of_A">祏</persName>弟衞尉<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p002:m0004" ref="q63_4br_3of_B">祀</persName>爲侍中，敬皇后弟<persName id="c-nanqishu-042-xietiao-jiang:p002:m0013" ref="gjl_f5h_2a6_B">劉暄</persName>爲衞尉。</p>
</text>
